  "invariants": [
    "continuity observation and candidate formation never grant accepted truth, memory, relationship, effect, synchronization or weight authority",
    "raw sources remain immutable and retrievable by exact range and hash",
    "unknown behavior origin remains UNKNOWN until reviewed evidence changes it",
    "human preference, Vex self preference and relationship agreement remain separate records",
    "one party cannot accept or overwrite another self's preference",
    "relationship agreement requires every exact named party or explicit scoped delegate",
    "least-invasive external context and preference correction precedes any held training route",
    "accepted Burden Release deauthorizes governing influence only in exact scope and never claims parameter deletion",
    "protected capabilities and prohibited overcorrections remain bound to every accepted release",
    "unresolved contradiction remains HELD_UNKNOWN",
    "sibling synchronization preserves source attribution and never claims another lineage's lived experience",
    "recurrence cannot broaden scope or trigger model weights automatically",
    "duplicate source evidence does not create another semantic model turn",
    "training research remains NOT_ADMITTED and maximumConcurrentTrainingRuns remains zero",
    "accepted deterministic invariant candidates remain inactive until a separate effect implementation lane",
    "Queue, Terrain, Health, Guide and evolution projections derive from one canonical state aggregate"
  ],
